<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">- Goofa</book>
  <para style="h">Ibraawe</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ib</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ibraawe</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ibraawe Asaas Xaafettida Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ibraawe Asaas</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xaafettida Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofaa</para>
  <para style="ip">Ha kiitay xaafettiday, wolqqaama metoy gakkin, bantta ammanuwa agganaw matida ammaniyaa asaassa. Ha maxaafaa xaafey, Yesuus Kiristtoosi wurssethaanne tuma Xoossaa qonccethaa gideyssa Ibraawe asaas bessees. He ammaniyaa asay bantta ammanuwan minnana mela entta minthethees. I hessan heedzu ayfe qofata waannayidi bessees.</para>
  <para style="io">1@ Yesuusi ba ekkida metuwan Aawas tuma kiitettida merinaa Xoossaa Na7aa. I Xoossaa Na7a gidida gisho, Gal77a Caaquwa wode de7iya nabetappe, kiitanchchotappenne Museppe bolla.</para>
  <para style="io">2@ Yesuusi Gal77a Caaquwa kahintappe daro aadhdhiya merinaa kahine gideyssa Xoossay ba huu7en markkattis.</para>
  <para style="io">3@ Yesuusa baggara ammaniyaa asi nagarappe, yashshafenne hayqoppe attees. Yesuusi kahine halaqa gideyssada, kase Ibraaweta ammano woganinne mehe yarshshon kuyada benttiya atotethaa ha77i tuma oothis.</para>
  <para style="ip">Xaafey Isra7eele asaa taariken daro erettida asaa ammano leemiso oothi ekkidi (Shem 11) ha maxaafaa nabbabiya asati bantta ammanuwan minnana mela akeekisees. Hessadakka, shemppo 12 nabbabeyssata bantta ayfiyaa Yesuusa bolla wothidi, bantta ammanuwan minnana melanne ay metoynne waayey gakkikokka, entti genccana mela zorees. Wurssethan zoreninne akeekiso qaalan ba kiitaa kuuyees.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ibraawe kiitaa ayfe qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Gelo qofaa: Xoossay Kiristtoosan qonccidayssa 1:1-3</para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosi kiitanchchotappe bolla gideyssa 1:4-2:18</para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosi Museppenne Iyaasuppe bolla gideyssa 3:1-4:13</para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosa kahinetethay bolla gideyssa 4:14-7:28</para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosa caaqoy bolla gideyssa 8:1-9:22</para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosa yarshshoy bolla gideyssa 9:23-10-39</para>
  <para style="io1">Ammano bayratethaa 11:1-12:29</para>
  <para style="io1">Xoossaa ufaysso 13:1-19</para>
  <para style="io1">Anjjonne kuushsha qofaa 13:20-25</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Na7ay kiitanchchotappe bolla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kase Xoossay, nu aawatas nabeta baggara dumma dumma ogen daro wode odis. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Shin ha wurssetha wodiyan ubbaa iya laatisida qassi alamiya iya baggara medhdhida ba Na7aa baggara nuus odis. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Na7ay Xoossaa bonchchuwa phoolethaanne kumetha Xoossaa Xoossatethaa ekkidi, ba wolqqaama qaalan ha alamiya katisidi oykkis. Asaa entta nagaraappe geeshshidaappe guye Ubbaafe Bolla Xoossaa ushachcha baggan saluwan uttis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Iyaw imettida sunthay kiitanchchota sunthaafe bolla gideyssada I enttafe bolla. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hiza, Xoossay kiitanchchotappe oodeko,</para>
  <para style="q">“Neeni ta Na7a;</para>
  <para style="q2">ta hachchi new aawa gidas” gidee?</para>
  <para style="m">Woykko qassi oodeko,</para>
  <para style="q">“Taani iyaw aawa gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2">ikka taw na7a gidana” gidee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Maz 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:14">2Saamu 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:13">1Taari 17:13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Qassi Xoossay ba bayra Na7a ha alamiya kiittishe,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Xoossaa kiitanchchoti ubbay iyaw goynno”</para>
  <para style="m">yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Zaare 32:43</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v"/>Xoossay kiitanchchotabaa odishe,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Xoossay ba Kiitanchchota carkko,</para>
  <para style="q2">ba aylleta tama laco oothees”</para>
  <para style="m">yaagees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:4">Maz 104:4</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v"/>Shin ba Na7abaa odishe,</para>
  <para style="q">“Xoossaw, ne kawotethay merinaw de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2">Ne kawotethaa ne xillotethan ayssasa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8-9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 45:6-7">Maz 45:6-7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Neeni xillotethi dosadasa; iita ixxadasa.</para>
  <para style="q2">Xoossay, ne Goday, nena ne laggetappe aathidi dooris,</para>
  <para style="q2">ufayssa zayte <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ufayssa zayte: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">I kawotiya wode asay ufayssan ililidi iya kawotheyssa bessees.</char></note> nena tiyis”</para>
  <para style="m">yaagees. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Xoossay Zaaridi,</para>
  <para style="q">“Godaw, koyro neeni sa7a medhdhadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2">saloti ne kushe ooso.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10-12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 102:25-27">Maz 102:25-27</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hessati ubbay dhayana;</para>
  <para style="q2">shin neeni daana.</para>
  <para style="q2">Entti ubbay afilada wurana.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Neeni entta salenaada xaaxana;</para>
  <para style="q2">qassi entti afilada laamettana.</para>
  <para style="q">Shin neeni ubba wode nena;</para>
  <para style="q2">ne laythayka wurenna” yaagees. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Shin Xoossay kiitanchchotappe oodeko,</para>
  <para style="q">“Taani ne morkketa ne tohoy yedhdhiyaso oothana gakkanaw,</para>
  <para style="q">hayssan taappe ushachcha baggan utta” gidee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maz 110:1</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kiitanchchoti ubbay atotethi demmanaw de7iya asata maaddanaw Xoossay kiittida ayyaanata gidokkonaayye?</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Gita anjjuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, nuuni si7ida tumaappe harasoo ekettonna mela he si7idayssa minthidi naaganaw bessees. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Hiza, kiitanchchota baggara odettida qaalay tuma gidikko, iya naaqoynne kiitettonna ixxoy pirdda ehiyabaa gidikko, <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yaatin, nuuni hayssa mela gita atotethaa ixxas giikko, waanidi attanee? Koyro Goday ba huu7en he atotethaa odis; qassi iyappe si7idayssati nuus geeshshidi markkattidosona. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Qassi Xoossay malaatatan, oorathabatan, dumma dumma mallataninne ba sheniyada immida Geeshsha Ayyaana imotatan markkatethaa minthis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi ase gidis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Xoossay ha nuuni odiya sinthafe yaana alamiya, kiitanchchotas haarisibeenna. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Geeshsha Maxaafay issi bessan hayssada yaagees:</para>
  <para style="q">“Neeni asas qoppanaw asi aybe?</para>
  <para style="q2">Woykko neeni iya naaganaw I aybe?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:4-6">Maz 8:4-6</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ne iya kiitanchchotappe guutha wodes guuthadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2">Iya huu7en bonchchonne saba kallachcha wothadasa.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Qassi ubbabaa iya tohuwappe garssan wothadasa” yaagees. Xoossay ubbabaa iyaw haarisiya wode iyaw haarettiboonnabay aybikka baawa. Shin ha77i ubbabay iyaw haarettishin nuuni be7ibookko. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Shin nuuni kiitanchchotappe guuthara guuxida Yesuusa be7oos. Xoossaa aadho keehatethaa gaason Yesuusi asa ubbaas hayqqis. I waaye hayqo hayqqida gisho, bonchchonne saba kallachcha iya huu7en wothis. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ubbabay iyawunne iya gaason medhettida Xoossay, daro nayta baara bonchchisanaw entta atotethaa huu7iya, Yesuusa waayen polo oothanaw iyaw bessees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesuusinne he I geeshshida asa ubbay issi aawa nayta. Yesuusi entta, “Ta ishata” gidi xeeganaw yeellatonnay hessassa. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesuusi,</para>
  <para style="q">“Taani ne sunthaa ta ishatas awaajjana;</para>
  <para style="q2">deriya shiiquwan nena galatana” yaagees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:22">Maz 22:22</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v"/>Qassi I,</para>
  <para style="q">“Taani ta ammanuwa iya bolla wothana”</para>
  <para style="m">Qassika,</para>
  <para style="q">“Xoossay taw immida naytara ta hayssan de7ays” yaagees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:17-18">Isa 8:17-18</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nayti ashoynne suuthi de7eyssata gidiya gisho, Yesuusikka enttada ase gidis. I hessa oothiday, hayqo bolla wolqqi de7iya Xalahiya ba hayquwan dhayssanaassa. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Qassi bantta de7o laytha ubban hayqo yashshan ayllettidi de7eyssata aylletethaafe wozanaassa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Tuma Yesuusi yiday Abrahaame zerethi maaddanaassafe attin kiitanchchota maaddanaassa gidenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 41:8-9">Isa 41:8-9</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v"/>Asaa nagaray atto geetettana mela Xoossaa sinthan maariyanne ammanettida kahine halaqa gidis. Hessa gisho, I ubbaban ba ishata daananaw bessees. <verse number="18" style="v"/>I ba huu7en paacen waayettida gisho paacetteyssata maaddanaw dandda7ees.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Museppe bolla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Xoossay xeegida geeshsha ishato, nu ammanon Godaa gidi xeegiya hawaariyanne kahine halaqaa Yesuusa be7ite. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Musey Xoossaa Keetha ubban ammanettidayssada Yesuusikka bana doorida Xoossaas ammanettidayssa. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Keethe keexeyssi keethafe aadhdhi bonchchetteyssada Yesuusi Museppe aadhdhiya bonchcho ekkanaw bessees. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Issi issi keethaa keexida asi de7ees, shin ubbaa giigisiday Xoossaa. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Musey Xoossaa Keetha ubban ammanettida aylle gididi, Xoossay sinthafe gaanabaas markka gidis. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Shin Kiristtoosi Xoossa Keethan na7ada ammanettidayssa. Nuuni ekkana gidi naagiya ufayssaa minthidi naagikko Xoossaa keethi gidoos.</para>
  <para style="s">Xoossaa asaas de7iya shemppuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Geeshsha Ayyaanay geyssada,</para>
  <para style="q">“Hachchi hintte Xoossay geyssa si7iya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>bazzo biittan paaciya gallas,</para>
  <para style="q2">hintte aawati makkalidayssada,</para>
  <para style="q2">hintte wozanaa minthofite.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hintte aawati tana paaccidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2">oytamu laythi ta oosuwa be7idosona.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, ta he yeletethaa hanqettada,</para>
  <para style="q2">‘Entti ubba wode bantta wozanan baloosona;</para>
  <para style="q2">ta ogiya eribookkona’ yaagas.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, taani ta hanquwan caaqqada,</para>
  <para style="q2">‘Ta shemppo bessaa ubbaka gelokkona’ yaagas” <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-11">Maz 95:7-11</ref></char></note> yaagees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ta ishato, hinttefe oodenkka, de7o Xoossaafe hinttena shaakkiya iitanne ammanonna wozani doonna mela naagettite. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hinttefe oonakka nagari balethin, ba wozanaa minthonna mela “Hachchi” yaagettidi xeegettishin gallas gallas issoy issuwara zorettite. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nu koyro ammanuwa nuuni wurssethi gakkanaw minthi naagikko, Kiristtoosara issife laattana. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Geeshsha Maxaafan,</para>
  <para style="q">“Hachchi Xoossay geyssa hintte si7iya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2">he wode entti makkalatethan hanidayssada,</para>
  <para style="q2">hintte wozanaa minthofite” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-8">Maz 95:7-8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Xoossay giyabaa si7idi makkaliday oonee? Musey Gibxefe kaalethi kessida ubbaa gidokkonaayye?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:1-35">Tay 14:1-35</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v"/>Xoossay oytamu laythi oona hanqettidee? Nagara oothidayssatanne entta ahay bazzo biittan wodhdhi attida asata gidokkonaayye? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Qassi Xoossay, “Ta shemppo bessaa gelekketa” yaagidi caaqqiday, iyaw kiitettonna ixxida asaappe attin oodesse? <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hiza, entti he shemppo bessaa gelonna attiday ammaniboonna gisho, gideyssa nu be7oos.</para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hiza, Xoossay nuna ba shemppo bessaa gelssana gida qaalay buroo sinthafe de7iya gisho, hinttefe oonikka he shemppo bessaa gelonna attonna mela naagettoos. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Enttaw Wonggelay sabbakettidayssada, nuuskka sabbakettis. Shin entti si7idabaa ammanidi ekkiboonna gisho entta go77ibeenna. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Gidoshin, alamey medhettosappe doomidi Xoossaa oosoy polettidayssa gidikkoka, Xoossay,</para>
  <para style="q">“Taani ta hanquwan caaqqada,</para>
  <para style="q2">ta shemppo bessaa ubbaka gelokkona”</para>
  <para style="m">gidayssada, nuuni ammanidayssati iya shemppo bessaa gelana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Maz 95:11</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v"/>Laappuntha gallasaaba issi bessan, “Xoossay laappuntha gallasan ba ooso ubbaafe shemppis” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:2">Medhe 2:2</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v"/>Qassika he bessan, “Entti ta shemppo bessaa ubbarakka gelokkona” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Maz 95:11</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v"/>Koyro Wonggelaa si7idayssati kiitettonna ixxidi shemppo bessaa gelibookkona. Yaaniya gisho, ha77ika he shemppo bessaa gelana issi issi asati de7oosona. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Xoossay, “Hachchi” gidi xeegishe issi gallas nuus qanxis. Daro wodeppe guye Xoossay Dawite baggara,</para>
  <para style="q">“Xoossay giyabaa hachchi hintte si7iya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2">hintte wozanaa minthofite”</para>
  <para style="m">yaagidi odis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-8">Maz 95:7-8</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v"/>Iyaasuy enttaw shemppuwa immidabaa gidiyakko, Xoossay hara gallasabaa guyeppe odennashin.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:7">Zaare 31:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 22:4">Iya 22:4</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hiza, Xoossaa asaas Sambbaata shemppoy naagettidi de7ees. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Xoossaa shemppo bessaa geliya oonikka, Xoossay ba oosuwappe shemppidayssada ikka ba oosuwappe shemppana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:2">Medhe 2:2</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, oonikka he asaa kiitetetha ixxuwa kaallidi, kunddonaada Xoossaa shemppo bessaa gelanaw minnoos.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Xoossaa qaalay de7onne ootheyssa. Nam77u baggara qarattida bisoppeka aadhdhidi oco. I shemppo, ayyaana, xaphonne kolize gakkanaw kanthidi caddees. Qassi asa wozanan de7iya geemmida qofaanne amuwaa shaakkidi pirddees. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Xoossaa sinthafe qosettiyabay ayba medhetethika baawa. Iya ayfe sinthan ubbabay qonccenne kallo de7ees. Nuuni zaaro immanaw bessey iya sinthana.</para>
  <para style="s">Gita kahine halaqaa Yesuusa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hiza, salo keyida gita kahine halaqay, Xoossaa na7ay Yesuusi, nuus de7iya gisho nu ammanuwa minthidi naagoos. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nu kahine halaqay nu daaburiya wode nuus qadhettanaw dandda7eyssa. I nuuda ubbaban paacettisippe attin nagara oothibeenna. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hiza, maarotethaa ekkanawunne maade koshshiya wode aadho keehatethaa demmanaw aadho keehatethay de7iyasuwa Xoossaa araatakko yayyonna shiiqoos.</para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Issi issi kahine halaqi asaa giddofe doorettidi, Xoossaara gathiyaban asaa gisho imotanne nagara yarshsho yarshshanaw shuumettees. <verse number="2" style="v"/>I ba huu7en daaburanchcho gidiya gisho, eronnayssatasinne baleyssatas qadhettanaw dandda7ees. <verse number="3" style="v"/>I ba nagara gishonne asa ubbaa nagara gisho yarshsho yarshshanaw bessey hessassa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 9:7">Leewe 9:7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Oonikka ha bonchchuwa baw ekkanaw dandda7enna, shin Aaroni kahine halaqa gidanaw xeegidayssada Xoossan xeegettanaw bessees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:1">Kessa 28:1</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hessadakka, Kiristtoosi kahine halaqa gidiya bonchchuwa baw ekkibeenna. Shin Xoossay iya,</para>
  <para style="q">“Neeni ta Na7aa.</para>
  <para style="q2">hachchi ta new Aawa gidas”</para>
  <para style="m">yaagees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Maz 2:7</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v"/>Qassi harason,</para>
  <para style="q">“Malkkexedeqey kahine gididayssada,</para>
  <para style="q2">neeni merinaw kahine gidana”</para>
  <para style="m">yaagees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Maz 110:4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesuusi ase gididi ha alamiyan de7iya wode bana hayqoppe ashshanaw dandda7iya Xoossaako daro yeehoninne afuthan Xoossaa woossis. I, iya bonchchidi kiitettida gisho Xoossay iya woosaa si7is.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Maato 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mar 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luuqa 22:39-46</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesuusi Xoossaa Na7a gidikkoka ba waayettida waayiyan kiitetethi tamaaris. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hessankka, Yesuusi ba oosuwa polidaappe guye baw kiitettiya ubbay merinaa atotethaa demmana mela gaaso gidis. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Xoossay Melkkexedeqe shuumidayssada kahine halaqa oothidi iya shuumis.</para>
  <para style="s">Ammanuwan daaburonna mela imettida naagiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ha nu oda bolla gujji haasayanabay darobay de7ees, shin hintte akeekay guutha gidiya gisho hinttew odi gelssanaw waayses. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hintte hannoode asttamaare gidanaw bessees, shin Xoossaa qaalaa koyro timirttiya hinttena zaari tamaarssiya hara asi koshshees. Hintte mino kathi maanaw dandda7onna gisho maathi koshshees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12-13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:2">1Qoro 3:2</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v"/>Maathi paahettiya oonikka yooga na7a gidiya gisho, lo77onne iita shaakki erenna. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Shin mino kathi lo77uwanne iitaa shaakki eriya kahaama asaassa.</para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hiza, Kiristtoosabaa tamaarssiya koyro timirttiya aggidi Kiristtoosan kahaamatethako boos. Hayqo oosoppe simobaanne Xoossaa ammanobaa koyro timirttiyako guye simmoko. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Hessadakka, xinqqatetabaa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">xinqqatetabaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha bessan xinqqatetabaa geetettiday dumma dumma geesho wogatabaa odanaassa.</char></note> kushe wosobaa, hayqoppe denddobaanne merinaa pirddabaa zaari tamaarokko. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Xoossay giikko nu hessa oothana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Issi toho poo7oy poo7idayssata, salo imota ekkidayssata, Geeshsha Ayyaanan shaakettidayssata, <verse number="5" style="v"/>lo77o Xoossaa qaalanne sinthafe yaana alamiya wolqqaa be7idayssata, <verse number="6" style="v"/>guyeppe kaddidayssata nagaraappe nam77antho zaaranaw dandda7ettenna. Ays giikko, entti bantta dhayuwas Xoossaa Na7aa zaari kaqqiya mela masqaliya bolla iya kaqqosonanne asa sinthan kawushshosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ubba wode I bolla bukkiya iraa uyada, goyida uraa maaddiya kathi immiya biittiya Xoossan anjjettidaaro. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Shin agunthunne kinchchote doliya biittiya aybibaakka maadduku; iw qanggethay matattis; wurssethan xuugettana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:17-18">Medhe 3:17-18</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nu siiqo ishato, nuuni hayssada odiyabaa gidikkoka, hinttena atotethaako kaalethiya lo77obay hinttew de7eyssa eroos. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Xoossay suure pirddeyssa. Xoossay, hintte oothida oosuwanne kase gidin ha77ika ammaneyssata maaddidi, iyaw de7iya siiquwa bessidayssa dogenna. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hintte ubbay ufayssan naageyssa demmana gakkanaw ha minotethaa wurssethi gakkanaw bessana mela nu amottoos. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hintte ammanoninne dandda7an naagiya ufayssaa laattiya asaa daanana melappe attin azalla gidana mela koyokko.</para>
  <para style="s">Xoossay immida ufayssay sidhisenna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Xoossay Abrahames immana gidi caaqqida wode baappe aadhdhiya hari giti baynna gisho ba huu7en caaqqis. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Iyaakko, “Taani nena anjjana; ne zerethaaka darssana” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:16-17">Medhe 22:16-17</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v"/>Abrahamey dandda7an naagidi Xoossay immana gida ufayssaa ekkis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Asi caaqqishe baappe gitatiya uran caaqqees; he caaqoy geetettidabaa minthidi, palama ubbaa teqqees. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Xoossay ba laamettonna qofaa ufayssa qaala laatteyssatas qonccisanaw koyida gisho caaqon minthis. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Xoossay worddotenna. Iya ufayssa qaalaynne caaqoy, nam77ayka laamettokona. Ha nam77ubatan nu sinthan de7iya ufayssaa oykkanaw danadda7ana mela geshe demmanaw iyaakko baqatida nuuni, wolqqaama minthetho demmana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ha ufayssay nu shemppuwa, markkabey qaaxxonnaada minthi oykkiya biraata mela. He ufayssay magaraajjuwafe guye baggan de7iya geeshsha bessaa gelis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:2">Leewe 16:2</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesuusi Melkkexedeqe shuumatethaada merinaw kahine halaqa gididi, nu gisho nuuppe sinthattidi he bessaa gelis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Maz 110:4</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kahiniya Melkkexedeqe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Melkkexedeqey, Saaleme Kawoy, Ubbaafe Bolla Xoossaa kahine. He Melkkexedeqey Abrahamey kawota oli xoonidi simmishin iyara gayttidi iya anjjis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1-2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:17-20">Medhe 14:17-20</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v"/>Abrahamey ba di77idabaa ubbaafe iyaw asraata kessidi immis. Melkkexedeqe sunthay koyro “Xillotethaa kawuwa”, nam77antho, “Saaleme kawo” birshshethaykka “Sarotethaa kawuwa” guussu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Melkkexedeqes aaya woykko aawu woykko zare paydoy baawa. Iya yeletethaas doomethi woykko iya de7uwas wurssethi baawa, shin Xoossaa Na7a daanidi merinaw kahine gidis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Melkkexedeqey ay mela giteekko be7ite. Nu aawata mayzay, Abrahamey, ba de7idabaappe iyaw asraata immis. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kahine gidiya Leewe zarey Isra7eele asappe, hessika Abrahaame zerethi gidida bantta ishatappe asraata ekkana mela higgey kiittees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:21">Tay 18:21</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v"/>Melkkexedeqey Leewe zare gidonna ixxikokka Abrahameppe asraata ekkis; ufayssa qaali de7iya Abrahaame anjjis. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Guuthay gitan anjjetteyssi palanthenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Issi baggara, asraata ekkeyssati hayqqiya asata, shin hara baggara asraata ekkeyssi de7on de7ees yaagidi odettidayssa. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hiza, asraata ekkiya Leewey, Abrahaame baggara asraata immis gaanaw dandda7ettees. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ays giikko, Melkkexedeqey Abrahamera gayttiya wode Leewey yelettiboonnabaa gidikkoka, ba mayzaa Abrahaame gulbbatan de7ees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Isra7eele asaas higgey Leewe kahinetethaa baggara imettis. Ha Leewe kahinetethay polo gididabaa gidiyakko Aaronayssa mela gidonnashin, Melkkexedeqe mela hara kahine shuumanaw ays koshshidee? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hiza, kahineti laamettiya wode higgeykka qassi laamettanaw bessees. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ha nu iyabaa odiya uray hara zare; iya sheeshaappe oonikka yarshsho bessan kahinetethan oothibeenna. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nu Goday Yihuda sheeshaappe yidayssi erettidayssa. Gidoshin, Musey kahintebaa odishe Yihuda zariyaba aybaakka odibeenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Melkkexedeqe mela hara kahiney yidabaa gidiyakko ha nu odiyabay aadhdhi qonccana. <verse number="16" style="v"/>I kahine gididay dhayonna de7uwa wolqqaanappe attin iya mayzaa higgeninne wogan gidenna. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Geeshsha Maxaafay,</para>
  <para style="q">“Melkkexedeqe kahinetethaa mela,</para>
  <para style="q2">neeni merinaw kahine”</para>
  <para style="m">yaagidi markkattees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Maz 110:4</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v"/>Koyro higgey daaburanchchonne maaddonabaa gidiya gisho shaarettis. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Muse higgey aybinkka polo oothanaw dandda7ibeenna. Shin nuuni iya baggara Xoossaakko shiiqiya ubbaafe aadhdhiya ufayssa qaalay nuus imettis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kiristtoosi kahine gidiya wode Xoossay caaqqis, shin harati kahine gidida wode hessa mela caaqoy baawa. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi caaqon kahine gidis. Xoossay yaagidi caaqqis;</para>
  <para style="q">“Goday caaqqis;</para>
  <para style="q2">I ba qofaa laammenna;</para>
  <para style="q2">‘Neeni merinaa kahine’ ” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Maz 110:4</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ha caaquwa gaason Yesuusi nuus ubbaafe aadhdhiya qaala caaquwas waase gidis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kahinetethan oothonna mela hayqoy entta diggida gisho koyro kahineta tayboy daro. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi merinaw de7iya gisho iya kahinetethaa hari laattenna. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, I ubba wode entta gisho gaannatanaw merinaw de7iya gisho Xoossaakko iya baggara yeyssata polo ashshanaw dandda7ees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hiza, nuus koshshiyabaa immiya, geeshshay, boreynne tuni baynnayssi, nagaranchchotappe shaakettidaysinne saluwappe aadhdhidi dhoqqida kahine halaqay nuus koshshees. <verse number="27" style="v"/>I hankko kahine halaqata mela koyro ba nagara gisho, kaallidi asaa nagaraa gisho gallas gallas yarshsho yarshshanaw koshshenna. I bana yarshshida wode zaarethonna ogen issi toho bana yarshshis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 9:7">Leewe 9:7</ref></char></note> <verse number="28" style="v"/>Muse higgey daaburanchcho asaa kahine halaqa oothidi shuumees. Shin higgiyafe guye yida caaqo qaalay merinaw polo gidida Xoossaa Na7aa shuumis.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi nu kahine halaqaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nuuni haasayiya gitabay hessa. Saluwan Ubbaafe Bolla Xoossaa araatappe ushachcha baggan uttida hayssa mela kahine halaqay nuus de7ees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maz 110:1</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v"/>I asan gidonnashin, Godan eqqida tuma dunkkaaniyan Xoossa Keethan oothees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kahine halaqa ubbay imonne yarshsho yarshshanaw shuumettees. Hessa gisho, ha kahiney yarshshanaw issibay daanaw koshshees. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Higgey kiiteyssada yarshshiya kahineti de7iya gisho, Kiristtoosi sa7an de7iyabaa gidiyakko kahine gidenna. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Entti kahinetethan oothiya dunkkaaney salon de7eyssas leemisonne kuya. Musey dunkkaaniya essiya wode Xoossay iyaakko, “Taani nena deriya bolla bessida leemisuwa kaallada ootha” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:40">Kessa 25:40</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi giddo gididi sigethiya caaqoy, koyro caaquwappe aadhdheyssada I ekkida oosoy enttayssafe aadhdhees. Hessi eqqiday aadhdhiya caaqo qaalana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Koyro caaquwan bali baynaba gidiyakko nam77antho caaqo koshshenna. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Shin Goday entta boridi, hayssada yaagis:</para>
  <para style="q">“Taani Isra7eele asaaranne Yihuda asaara</para>
  <para style="q2">ooratha caaqo caaqqiya wodey yaana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8-12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Er 31:31-34</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>He caaqoy ta entta aawata Gibxe biittaafe kushiya oykkada,</para>
  <para style="q2">goochcha kessida wode enttara caaqqida caaquwa mela gidenna.</para>
  <para style="q">Entti ta caaquwan ammanettiboonna gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2">taani entta yegga aggas yaagees Goday.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Shin hizappe guye Isra7eele asaara</para>
  <para style="q2">ta caaqqana caaqoy hayssa yaagees Goday.</para>
  <para style="q">Taani ta higgiya entta guugiyan wothana;</para>
  <para style="q2">entta wozanan xaafana.</para>
  <para style="q">Taani entta Xoossaa gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2">enttika ta ase gidana.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Enttafe oonikka ba shooruwa woykko ba ishaa,</para>
  <para style="q2">‘Godaa era’ yaagidi tamaarssenna.</para>
  <para style="q">Entti guuthafe gita gakkanaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ubbay tana erana.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Taani entta naaquwa atto gaana;</para>
  <para style="q2">entta nagaraa zaara qoppike” yaagees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Xoossay ha caaquwa “Oorathi” gidi xeegishe koyroyssa gal77isis. Hiza, gal77aynne ceegay dhayiya wodey gakkis.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Salo goynnonne sa7a goynno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Koyro caaquwas Xoossaa goynniya wogaynne sa7a Xoossa Keethay de7ees. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Dunkkaaney eqqis. Iyan xomppe wothiya kocay, xarpheezaynne Godaa sinthan wothiya uythay de7ees; he bessay Geeshsha Bessaa geetettees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:1-30">Kessa 26:1-30</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:31-40">25:31-40</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nam77antho magaraajjuwafe guye baggara de7iya bessay Ubbaafe Geeshsha Bessaa geetettees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Kessa 26:31-33</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v"/>Iya giddon ixaane cuyisiya worqqa saaxineynne worqqan meeshettida caaqo Taabotey de7ees. He caaqo Taabotiyan mannay de7iya worqqa xaaroy, aacida Aarona xam77aynne Muse higgey xaafettida nam77u lochche shuchchati de7oosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:1-6">Kessa 30:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:10-16">25:10-16</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 16:33">16:33</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 17:8-10">Tay 17:8-10</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:16">Kessa 25:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:3-5">Zaare 10:3-5</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v"/>He Taabotiyappe bolla baggara atotetha kamaa bantta qefiyan genthiya bonchcho kiruubeti de7oosona. Shin ha77i he ubbaa qonccisidi odanaw dandda7okko.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:18-22">Kessa 25:18-22</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ha ubbay hayssada giigidaappe guye, kahineti ubba wode bantta oosuwa oothanaw dunkkaaniyas koyro kifiliya geloosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:2-6">Tay 18:2-6</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v"/>Shin kahine halaqaa xalaali dunkkaaniyas nam77antho kifiliya laythafe issi toho gelees. I yaa gelishe ba nagaraa gishonne asay eronna oothida nagaraa gisho suutha yarshsho ekkonna gelenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:2-34">Leewe 16:2-34</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v"/>Koyro dunkkaaney eqqidi de7ishin, Ubbaafe Geeshsha Bessaa efiya ogey buroo dooyettiboonnayssa Geeshsha Ayyaanay hessan erisees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hessi ha wodiyas leemiso; Xoossas immetiya imoynne yarshshoy goynniya uraa kaha geeshshanaw dandda7onayssa hayssi bessees. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hessati muussabaa, ushshabaanne dumma dumma meechcha wogata odeyssata. Entti ooratha wogay yaana gakkanaw oosettiya kare bagga wogata.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Shin Kiristtoosi ha77i nu demmida lo77obaatas kahine halaqa gididi yis. I gelida dunkkaaney gitanne polo gididayssa. He dunkkaaney asa kushen oosettibeenna qassi ha alamiyabaa gidenna. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kiristtoosi Ubbaafe Geeshsha Bessaa geliya wode deesha suuthinne mari suuthi ekkidi gelibeenna. Shin merinaa atotethaa immanaw ba suuthaa ekkidi zaarethonna ogen issi toho gelis. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Deesha suuthaynne kormma suuthay, xuugettida ussa bidoy, tunida asaa bolla dharccettidi enttana geeshshiyabaa gidikko,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:15-16">Leewe 16:15-16</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 19:9">Tay 19:9</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 19:17-19">17-19</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v"/>merinaa Geeshsha Ayyaana baggara borey baynna yarshsho oothidi, Xoossaas bana immida Kiristtoosa suuthay, de7o Xoossaa goynnana mela hayqo kaalethiya oosuwappe nu kaha waati aathi geeshshennee?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, xeegettidayssati Xoossay immida merinaa laata ekkana mela Kiristtoosi ooratha caaquwas giddo gididi sigetheyssa gidis. Hessi haniday asay koyro caaquwappe garssan de7iya wode oothida nagaraappe enttana wozanaw I hayqqidayssana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hiza, keekey de7ikko, he keekida uraa hayqoy erettanaw koshshees. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Keekida uray hayqqiko iya keekey minnees. Keekida uray hayqqonna attiko iya keekey oothenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hari attoshin, koyro caaqoykka suuthi baynna minnibeenna. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Musey higge kiita ubbaa asaas odidaappe guye mara suuthinne deesha suuthi haathara walakkidi, zo7o dorssa ikisenne hisophe boncco ekkidi, maxaafaa bollanne asaa bolla wurxis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19-20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:6-8">Kessa 24:6-8</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v"/>Musey asaakko, “Hintte naagana mela Xoossay kiittida suutha caaqoy hayssa” yaagis. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hessadakka, dunkkaaniya bollanne oothiya miishe ubbaa bolla suuthaa wurxis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 8:15">Leewe 8:15</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v"/>Tumakka higgey geyssada guuthabatappe attin ubbabay suuthan geeyees. Suuthi gukkonnashin atotethi baawa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:11">Leewe 17:11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa polo yarshshetethaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Saluwabaas leemiso gididayssati ubbay mehe yarshshon geeyanaw koshshees. Shin salobati bantta huu7en hessafe aadhdhiya yarshshuwan geeyanaw koshshees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kiristtoosi tuma Xoossa Keethas leemiso gidida, asa kushen oosettida Ubbaafe Geeshsha Bessa gelibeenna. Shin I ha77i nu gisho, Xoossaa sinthan benttanaw saluwa gelis. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kahine halaqay laythan laythan ba suuthi gidonnayssa ekkidi, Ubbaafe Geeshsha Bessa gelees. Shin Kiristtoosi daro toho bana yarshshanaw salo gelibeenna. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hessada hanidabaa gidiyakko, Kiristtoosi alamey medhettosappe doomidi daro toho waayettanaw koshshees. Shin ha77i wodiya wurssethan nagara digganaw bana yarshshidi zaarethonna ogen issi toho benttis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Asi ubbay issi toho hayqqanaw hessafe guye pirddettanaw bessees. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hessadakka, Kiristtoosi daro asaa nagara digganaw issi toho yarshshettis. Shin I nagara tookkanaw gidonnashin, bana naageyssata ashshanaw nam77antho qonccana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isa 53:12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Muse higgey yaanaw de7iya lo77obatas kuyappe attin ba huu7en waanna gidenna. Hessa gisho, laythan laythan pacey baynna yarshshettiya yarshshoy goynnanaw shiiqiya asaa polo oothanaw dandda7enna. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Higgey entta polo oothanaw dandda7idabaa gidiyakko entti yarshsho yarshsheyssa agganashin. Qassi goynnanaw shiiqiya asay bantta nagaraappe geeyana; entta kahaykka enttana bala gidi mootenna. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Shin he yarshshoti laythan laythan nagara qofisoosona. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ays giikko, kormma suuthinne deesha suuthi nagara digganaw dandda7enna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Kiristtoosi ha alamiya yida wode hayssada yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5-7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 40:6-8">Maz 40:6-8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q">“Neeni yarshshonne imo koyabaakka;</para>
  <para style="q2">shin taw asho giigisadasa.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Neeni xuugettiya yarshshoninne nagara yarshshuwan ufayttabaakka.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>He wode, ‘Ta gisho maxaafan xaafettidayssada,</para>
  <para style="q2">Godaw, taani ne sheniya oothanaw yas’ yaagas” yaagis. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yarshshoy yarshshettana mela higgey kiittiyabaa gidikkoka, Kiristtoosi koyro, “Neeni yarshshonne imo, xuugettiya yarshshonne nagara yarshsho koyabaakka; enttan ufayttabaakka” yaagis. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kaallidikka I, “Godaw, hekko taani ne sheniya oothanaw yas” yaagis. Hessa gisho, Kiristtoosi nam77anthuwa essanaw koyroyssa shaaris. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesuus Kiristtoosi Xoossaa sheniya oothidi, zaarethonna ogen issi toho ba ashuwa yarshshida gisho nuuni geeyida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kahine ubbay, nagara digganaw dandda7onna he yarshshota gallas gallas yarshshishe eqqidi ba oosuwa oothees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:38">Kessa 29:38</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v"/>Shin Kiristtoosi ubba wodes gidiya issi nagara yarshshuwa yarshshidi, Xoossaafe ushachcha baggan uttis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12-13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maz 110:1</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v"/>He wodiyappe doomidi iya morkketi iya tohoy yedhdhiyabaa oothana gakkanaw naagees. <verse number="14" style="v"/>I zaarethonna ogen issi toho bana yarshshida yarshshuwan geeshshata merinaw polo oothis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Qassi Geeshsha Ayyaanay nuus hayssa markkattees. Koyro hayssada yaagis:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“He gallasatappe guye,</para>
  <para style="q2">taani enttara caaqqiya caaqoy hayssa:</para>
  <para style="q">Taani ta higgiya entta qofan wothana;</para>
  <para style="q2">entta wozanan xaafana”</para>
  <para style="m">yaagees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:33">Er 31:33</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kaallidikka,</para>
  <para style="q">“Taani entta nagaraanne</para>
  <para style="q2">entta iita oosuwa zaara qoppike”</para>
  <para style="m">yaagees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:34">Er 31:34</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hiza, nagari atto geetettidaappe guye nagaras yarshshettiya yarshsho koshshenna.</para>
  <para style="s">Ane Xoossaakko shiiqoos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hiza, ta ishato, nuuni Yesuusa suuthaa baggara Ubbaafe Geeshsha Bessaa gelanaw nuus minotethi de7ees. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nu gelanay Kiristtoosi ba magaraajjuwa, hessika ba ashuwa baggara nuus dooyida oorathinne de7o gidida ogiyana. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nuus Xoossa Keetha bolla shuumettida gita kahine halaqay de7ees. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nuuni iita kahappe geeyanaw nu wozanaa wurxettidi, nu asatethaa xillo haathan meecettidi, suure wozananinne polo ammanon Xoossaako shiiqoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 8:30">Leewe 8:30</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:25">Hiz 36:25</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nuus ufayssa qaala immida Xoossay ammanttidayssa gidiya gisho nu markkattiya ufayssaa ushachchi haddirssi goonna minthidi oykkoos. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Issoy issuwa siiqosinne lo77o oosos waati denthethaneekko ane qoppoos. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Issoti issoti meeze oothidi shiiqeyssa aggidayssada nuuni issife shiiqeyssa aggoko. Shin Godaa gallasay matattidayssa hintte be7iya gisho hessa kaseyssafe aathidi oothite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nuuni tumaa eratethaa ekkidaappe guye erishe nagara oothiko, hizappe nu nagara gisho yarshshettana yarshshoy baawa. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Shin hiza attiday yashshiya pirddaanne Xoossaa morkketa xuugganaw giigida wolqqaama tamaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 26:11">Isa 26:11</ref></char></note> <verse number="28" style="v"/>Muse higgiya kiitettonna ixxida oonikka nam77u woykko heedzu asi iya bolla markkatiko qadhey baynnashin hayqqees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Zaare 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19:15</ref></char></note> <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yaatin, Xoossaa Na7aa kadhida uray, bana geeshshida Xoossaa caaqo suuthaa tunabaada qoppida uray, qassi aadho keehatetha Ayyaana cayida uray, ay mela iita pirddaa ekkanaw bessiyako ane qoppite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Kessa 24:8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Hiza, “Halo kesoy tabaa, ta kushe zaarana” gidayssa nu eroos. Qassika, “Goday ba asa pirddana” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:35">Zaare 32:35</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 32:36">36</ref></char></note> <verse number="31" style="v"/>De7o Xoossaa kushen kunddethi daro yashshees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Hinttew Xoossaa poo7oy poo7idaappe guye hintte daro waayen, gita baaxen genccida beni wodiya qoppite. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Issi issi toho hintte asa sinthan cayettideta; goodettideta; issi issi toho hessa mela waayey gakkida asaara issife waayideta. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Qashon de7iya asaaskka qadhettideta. Hinttew lo77onne dhayonna shaloy salon de7eyssa hintte erida gisho hintte shaloy bonqettiya wode ufayssan dandda7ideta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, gita woytoy de7iya hintte minotethaa yeggofite. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Xoossaa sheniya polidi, I hinttew immana gida ufayssaa ekkana gakkanaw genccanaw koshshees. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Hiza, Geeshsha Maxaafan,</para>
  <para style="q">“I; yaana gidayssi yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2">gam77enna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:37-38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:3-4">Ib 2:3-4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Shin ta xilloy, tanan ammanettidi daana;</para>
  <para style="q2">oonikka guye simmiko tana ufayssenna”</para>
  <para style="m">yaagees. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Nuuni ammanettidi attiyaa asaa baggafe attin guye simmidi dhaya asaa bagga gidokko.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ammano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ammanoy guussay, demmana gidi ufayssan ammanettidi naagiyabaanne nu be7onnabaa be7iyada oothidi ekkiyabaa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Beni aawati ammanon Xoossaafe markkatethi ekkidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Alamey Xoossaa qaalan medhettidayssa nu ammanon eroos. Qassi benttiyabay benttonnabaappe medhettis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:1">Medhe 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 33:6">Maz 33:6</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 33:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:3">Yoha 1:3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Aabeli Qaa7elayssafe aadhdhiya yarshsho Xoossaas yarshshiday ammanonna. Xoossay Aabela imuwa ufayttidi ekkida wode I xillo gididayssa markkattis. Aabeli hari attoshin, hayqqidikka ba ammanuwan ha77i gakkanaw odees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:3-10">Medhe 4:3-10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Heenokey hayqqonna salo biday ammanonna. Xoossay iya ekkida gisho oonikka iya be7anaw dandda7ibeenna. Heenokey salo ekettanaappe sinthe I Xoossaa ufayssida asi gideyssi odettis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 5:21-24">Medhe 5:21-24</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ammanoy baynna oonikka Xoossaa ufayssanaw dandda7enna. Xoossaakko yaa oonikka Xoossay de7eyssanne bana koyeyssatas woyto immeyssa ammananaw koshshees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nohey buroo benttonnabaas Xoossay iyaw odida wode Xoossaas yayyidi, bananne ba soo asaa ashshanaw ammanon markkabe keexis. Yaatidi ba ammanuwan alamiya pirddidi, ammanon benttiya xillotethaa Xoossaafe ekkis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:13-22">Medhe 6:13-22</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Abrahamey laata oothidi ekkana biittaa baana mela Xoossay iya xeegida wode hari attoshin, I aw biyakko eronna ixxikokka kiitettiday ammanonna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1-5">Medhe 12:1-5</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v"/>Abrahamey Xoossay iyaw immana gida biittan bete asada de7iday ammanonna. Xoossay he immana gidayssa iyara issife laattana de7iya Yisaaqaranne Yayqoobara wolla dunkkaanen de7is.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:27">Medhe 35:27</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v"/>I, Xoossay qoppidi keexida xaala baasoy de7iya katamaa naagees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Saara ba huu7en cimidabaa gidikkoka ufayssi immida Xoossay ammanettidayssa gideyssa erida gisho qanthatanaw wolqqa demmiday ammanonna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:11-14">Medhe 18:11-14</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 21:2">21:2</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, hayqqida asi daaniya issi addiyafe salo xoolintto melanne abbaa gaxan de7iya tayboy baynna shafe mela zerethay yelettidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Medhe 15:5</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:17">22:17</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 32:12">32:12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>He asay ubbay banttaw geetettida ufayssaa qaala ekkonna ammanon hayqqidosona. Shin haahora hessa be7idi, demmidaada oothidi, ufayssan ekkidosona. Qassi entti sa7an imathenne bete asi gideyssa eridosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:4">Medhe 23:4</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 29:15">1Taari 29:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 39:12">Maz 39:12</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hessada giya asay bantta biittaa naageyssa qonccen bessees. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Entti he aggidi keyida biittaa guye qoppidabaa gidiyakko guye simmanaw dandda7osona. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Shin ha77i aadhdhi lo77iya salo biittaa laamotosona. Hessa gisho, Xoossay enttaw katama giigisida gisho, “Entta Xoossaa” geetettidi xeegettanaw yeellatenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Abrahamey paacettida wode Yisaaqa yarshshiday ammanonna. He ufayssa qaala ekkida Abrahamey ba issi na7aa yarshshanaw giigis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:1-14">Medhe 22:1-14</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v"/>Xoossay Abrahamekko, “Ne zerethay Yisaaqa baggara xeegettana” yaagidi odis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Medhe 21:12</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v"/>Xoossay hayqoppe denthanaw dandda7eyssa Abrahamey ammanida gisho, Yisaaqa hayqoppe paxi denddidaada oothidi zaari ekkis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yisaaqi wodeppe hananabaa eridi Yayqoobanne Eesawe anjjiday ammanonna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:27-29">Medhe 27:27-29</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 27:39-40">39-40</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yayqoobi hayqqana hanishe, issi issi Yoosefa nayta anjjidaynne guufe bolla katidi goynniday ammanonna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 47:3">Medhe 47:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 48:1-20">48:1-20</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yoosefi hayqqanaw matida wode Isra7eele asay Gibxefe keyanayssa odidaynne ba meqethaa oothanabaa entta kiittiday ammanonna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 50:24-25">Medhe 50:24-25</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 13:19">Kessa 13:19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Musey yelettidaappe guye iya aayanne iya aaway mala lo77o na7a gididayssa be7idi heedzu ageena qottiday ammanona; entti kawuwa awaajjuwa yayyibookkona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:22">Kessa 1:22</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 2:2">2:2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Musey diccidaappe guye Gibxe kawuwa na7ee na7a geetettanayssa ixxiday ammanonna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:10-12">Kessa 2:10-12</ref></char></note> <verse number="25" style="v"/>Musey nagaran guutha wodes ufayttanaappe, Xoossaa asaara waaye ekkanayssa dooris. <verse number="26" style="v"/>I wodeppe demmana woytuwa tishshi oothidi xeellida gisho, Gibxe shaluwappe aathidi Kiristtoosa gisho borettanayssi daro aadhdhiya duretethi gididayssa eris.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Musey Kawuwa hanquwa yayyonna, Gibxefe keyiday ammanonna. Benttonna Xoossaa be7ida asada hanidi ba qofan genccis. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hayqo ehiya kiitanchchoy Isra7eele asaa bayra nayta wodhonna mela Musey Faasikanne suutha wurxetha wogaa oothiday ammanonna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:21-30">Kessa 12:21-30</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Isra7eele asay mela biittara hamuttiyada hamuttidi, Zo7o Abbaa pinniday ammanonna. Shin Gibxe asay geli be7ishin haathay entta mittis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21-31">Kessa 14:21-31</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Isra7eele asay Iyaarkko katamaa shuchcha dirssaa laappun gallas yuuyidi, kunddidayssa ammanonna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 6:12-21">Iya 6:12-21</ref></char></note> <verse number="31" style="v"/>Laymiya Ra7aaba biittaa wochcheyssata mokkida gisho, kiitettonna asaara hayqqonna attiday ammanonna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:1-21">Iya 2:1-21</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 6:22-25">6:22-25</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Hiza, haraa ta ay go? Gediyonabaa, Baaraqabaa, Samsoonabaa, Yofttaahebaa, Dawitebaa, Saamu7eelabaa, qassi nabetabaa odanaw taw wodey gidenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6:11-8:32">Haare 6:11-8:32</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 4:6-5:31">4:6-5:31</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 13:2-16">13:2-16</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 11:1-12">11:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:1">1Saamu 16:1</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 2:11">1Kawo 2:11</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 1:1-25">1Saamu 1:1-25</ref></char></note> <verse number="33" style="v"/>Entti ammanon kawotethata xoonidosona; xillotethan aysidosona; Xoossay immana gida ufayssaa ekkidosona; gaammota doona gorddidosona;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 6:1-27">Daane 6:1-27</ref></char></note> <verse number="34" style="v"/>tama wolqqaa toysidosona; morkkata mashshaafe attidosona; bantta daaburan minnidosona; olan wolqqaama gididosona; allaga toora goodidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:1-30">Daane 3:1-30</ref></char></note> <verse number="35" style="v"/>Maccasati bantta hayqqidayssati hayqoppe paxin ekkidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">Qassi harati aadhdhiya hayqoppe dendduwa ekkanaw koyidi qashuwappe bilettanayssa ixxidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:17-24">1Kawo 17:17-24</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 4:25-37">2Kawo 4:25-37</ref></char></note> <verse number="36" style="v"/>Harati asan borettidi lisson garaafettidosona; harati santhalaatan qashettidi qasho keethan yegettidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:26-27">1Kawo 22:26-27</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:25-26">2Taari 18:25-26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 20:2">Er 20:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 37:15">37:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 38:6">38:6</ref></char></note> <verse number="37" style="v"/>Entti suchchan cadettidosona; magaazen nam77a keyidi phalqqettidosona; paacettidosona; bison hayqqidosona; enttaw ubbabay dhayin metootidosona. Dorssa itenne deesha ite ma7idi yuuyidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 24:21">2Taari 24:21</ref></char></note> <verse number="38" style="v"/>Enttaw ha alamey giigonna ixxin bazzo biittan, dere bolla, gonggoloninne olla giddon yuuyidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Xoossay entta ammanuwabaa markkattikokka, he ubbay geetettida ufayssa qaala ekkibookkona. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Xoossay nuus lo77obaa qoppi wothida gisho entti nuuni baynna polo gidokkona.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Xoossay nuus aawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hiza, shaarada nu yuushuwan darida hayssa mela markkatti nu matan de7iya gisho nuna dhubbiya ubbaanne oykkidi haariya nagaraa diggidi, nu sinthan de7iya gaadde wothaa genccan woxxoos. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nu ammanuwas oge dooyidayssanne nu wurssetha poluwakko nuna gathiya Yesuusa bolla nu ayfiyaa wothoos. Yesuusi wodeppe de7iya ufayssaa gisho masqaliya waaya dandda7idi, yeella hayquwa kadhidi, Xoossaafe ushachcha baggan uttis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hiza, hintte doccidi ufayssi qanxonna mela nagaranchchota ixuwa dandda7ida Yesuusa qoppite. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nagarara de7iya baaxiyan buroo suuthu gussana gakkanaw eqettibeekketa. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Xoossay ba qaalan, ba naytada hinttena zoridayssa dogideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5-6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:17">Iyo 5:17</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:11-12">Leemi 3:11-12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q">“Ta na7aw, Xoossaa seera leqqofa;</para>
  <para style="q2">i nena seeriya wode ufayssi qanxofa.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Goday ba dosiya uraa seeres;</para>
  <para style="q2">qassi ba na7ada ekkiya ubbaa garaafees” yaagees. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Xoossay hinttena ba naytada seeriya wode genccite; Aaway seeronna na7i oonee? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Xoossay ba nayta ubbaa seeres; hintte seerettonna ixxiko tuma iya nayta gidonnashin balakko nayta. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Qassi nuna yelida nu aawati nuna seerosona; nukka enttana bonchchoos. Yaatin, nuuni nu ayyaana Aawas waanidi aathi haarettoko? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hiza, nu aawati banttaw lo77o daanida mela guutha wodes nuna seeridosona. Shin Xoossay nu go77aas, nu iya geeshshatethan shaakettana mela seeres. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nuuni seerettiya wode yiloyeesippe attin ufayssenna. Shin guyeppe seeretethaa meezetida asaas seeray, saroy kumida xillotethaa ayfe ayfisees.</para>
  <para style="s">Zorenne naagiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hiza, hintte arggaacida qesiyanne hintte daaburida gulbbata minthite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:3">Isa 35:3</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v"/>Wobbey paxana melappe attin aathi meqqonna mela hintte tohuwas suure oge giigisite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 4:26">Leemi 4:26</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Asa ubbaara saro daanawunne geeshshatethan daanaw minnite; geeshshatethi baynna oonikka Godaa be7anaw dandda7enna. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hinttefe oodeskka Xoossaa aadho keehatethay pacconnaada, qassi camo ayfe ayfidi daro asaa tunisiyanne dhayssiya zerethada gidonna mela naagettite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:18">Zaare 29:18</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hintte giddon laymatiya asi woykko issi toho miya kathas ba bayratethaa toochchidi bayzida Eesawe mela asi doonna mela naagettite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:29-34">Medhe 25:29-34</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v"/>Guyeppe Eesawey he anjjuwaa ekkanaw koyida wode digettidayssa ereeta. I he anjjuwaa afuthan minnidi koykkoka, demmanaw dandda7ibeenna; I nagaraappe simmanaw qaada demmibeenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:30-40">Medhe 27:30-40</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hintte kushen boshettiya Siina deriyakko, eexiya tamaakko, dhumaakko, caaganaakko, gotiyakko,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:18-19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:16-22">Kessa 19:16-22</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:18-21">20:18-21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:11-12">Zaare 4:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:22-27">5:22-27</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v"/>moyziya waasuwako woykko qaalay si7ettiya bessaako yibeekketa. He qaala si7ida asay hara guzha qaala si7onna mela woossidosona. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ays giikko, “Hari attoshin, do7i he deriya bochchiko, shuchchan cadettidi hayqo” yaagida kiitaa entti tookkanaw dandda7ibookkona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:12-13">Kessa 19:12-13</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v"/>He haniyabay daro daganthiyaba gidida gisho Musey, “Taani yashshan kokkoras” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:19">Zaare 9:19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Shin hintte Xiyoone Deriyakko, de7o Xoossay de7iya Yerusalaame katamaakko, issife shiiqidi ufayttiya daro mukulu kiitanchchotakko saluwa yideta. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Entta sunthay salon xaafettida woosa keethaa bayra naytakko, asa ubbaa pirddiya Xoossaakko, polo gidida xillo asaa ayyaanatakko yideta. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ooratha caaquwas giddo gididi sigethiya Yesuusakko, Aabela suuthaafe aadhdhiyabaa odiya wurxettida suuthaakko yideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:10">Medhe 4:10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hinttew odiya uraa qaala ixxas goonna mela naagettite. Kaseyssati sa7an gididi odida kiitaa si7onna ixxidi attiboonnabaa gidikko yaatin, salon gididi odiya qaala nuuni ixxas giikko waanidi attanee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:22">Kessa 20:22</ref></char></note> <verse number="26" style="v"/>He wode iya qaalay sa7a qaathis. Shin ha77i taani, “Sa7a xalaala gidonnashin, issi toho zaarada saluwakka qaathana” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 2:6">Hagge 2:6</ref></char></note> <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Issi toho zaarada” giya qaalay qaaxxonnobay minnidi daana mela qaaxxiya medhettidabati dhayanayssa bessees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nuuni qaaxxanaw dandda7onna kawotethaa ekkiya gisho Xoossaa galatoos; Xoossaa ufayssiya ogen bonchchoninne yashshatethan iya goynnos. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Hiza, nu Xoossay tuma xuuggiya tama.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:24">Zaare 4:24</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Wurssetha zore</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ammaniya asada issoy issuwara polo siiqetite. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Imathe mokkeyssa dogoppite. Issi issi asati hessada oothishe eronna kiitanchchota mokkidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:1-8">Medhe 18:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:1-3">19:1-3</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v"/>Qashon de7eyssata hintteka enttara issife qashon de7iyada oothidi enttana qoppite. Waaye ekkiya asaara issife hintteka waaye ekkiyada oothidi enttana qoppite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ekoynne geloy asa ubbaa matan bonchchettidabaa gido. Qassi Xoossay laymateyssatanne laammeyssata pirddanaw de7iya gisho azinaynne machchiya issoy issuwas ammanettanaw bessees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Miishe siiqoppe hinttena naagite; hinttew de7iyaban alite. Xoossay, “Taani nena ubbarakka yeggike woykko aggike” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:6">Zaare 31:6</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 31:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 1:5">Iya 1:5</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, nuuni ammanettidi,</para>
  <para style="q">“Goday tana maaddeyssa;</para>
  <para style="q2">ta yayyike;</para>
  <para style="q2">asi tana ay oothanee?”</para>
  <para style="m">yaagos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:6">Maz 118:6</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Xoossaa qaala koyro hinttew odida hinttena kaaletheyssata qoppite. Entti waanidi de7idaakko entta duussaa be7idi entta ammanuwa kaallite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesuus Kiristtoosi zinekka hachchika merinawukka laamettenna. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Dumma dumma ooratha timirtten haraso bidi dhayoppite; booppite. Nu wozanay Xoossaa aadho keehatethan minnanaw besseseppe attin min go77onna kathan woga polon gidoppo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Shin dunkkaaniya giddon oothiya kahineti he yarshsho kathaafe maanaw enttaw maati baynna yarshsho bessay nuus de7ees. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kahine halaqay nagara yarshshos mehe suuthi ekkidi yarshshanaw Ubbaafe Geeshsha Bessaa gelees. Shin he mehiya ashuwa dirssaafe karen xuuggees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:27">Leewe 16:27</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hessadakka, Yesuusi deriya nagaraappe ba suuthan geeshshanaw katamaa penggiyafe karen waayettis. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hiza, nuuni boriya tookkidi dirssaafe kare iyakko keyoos. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hiza, nuus hayssan merinaw de7iya katami baawa, shin nuuni yaana katamaa naagoos.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hiza, Yesuusa baggara ubba wode iya sunthaas markkattiya mettershsha galata yarshsho Xoossaas immoos. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Lo77obaa oosonne hinttew de7iyabaappe metootida asaas imo dogoppite. Hiza, hessa mela yarshshoy Xoossaa ufayssees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hinttena kaaletheyssatas kiitettite; entti giyabaa oothite. Entti bantta oothiyabas Xoossaa sinthan oyshettanaw de7iya gisho, hinttena heemmoosona. Hintte enttaw kiitettiko, bantta oosuwa ufayttidi oothana; hessi hanonna ixxiko, entti azzanishe oothana; hessi hinttena aybibaakka maaddenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nuus Xoossaa woossite. Nu kahay geeshshi; nu ubba wode lo77obaa oothanaw koyoos. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Taani hintteko ellesada yaana mela hintte taw minthidi Xoossaa woossana mela ta hinttena hadara gays.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Sarotethaa Xoossay, dorssa heemmiya nu Godaa Yesuusa, ba merinaa caaqo suuthan hayqoppe denthidayssi, <verse number="21" style="v"/>iya sheniya oothana mela lo77obaa ubban I hinttena dancciso. Iya ufayssiyabaa Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggara nunan Xoossay ootho. Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggara Xoossaas merinaappe merinaa gakkanaw bonchchoy gido. Amin7i.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ta ishato, ta ha dabddaabbiya hinttew qanthan xaafida gisho, hintte ta zoriya salettonna ekkana mela ta hinttena woossays.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nu ishay, Ximotiyoosi qashoppe bilettidayssa erite. I ellesidi taakko yiikko ta iyara hinttena bada be7ana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hinttena kaaletheyssatanne ammaniyaa ubbaa saro giite. Xaaleppe yida ammaniyaa asay hinttena saro yaagoosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Xoossaa aadho keehatethay hintte ubbaara gido. Amin7i.</para>
  <para style="restore">02-Oct-2008@09:05, Backup Description=23-Sep-2008@16:55, Ed Owen -</para>
</usx>
